  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/039TrXtZD08\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Satisfying Buttons 用於在 Prominence II RPG 中創建火焰按鈕動畫</em></p>\n<p>你是否注意到 Minecraft 的按鈕完全沒有聲音？大多數現代遊戲在懸停於 UI 元素上時都有微妙的滴答聲，以模擬反饋。這個模塊添加了一個簡單的更改，使導航主菜單更加滿意。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172669/description_489291c8-b83e-4406-b424-aa4ee92e4020.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna Pixel&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Txni&labelColor=36633c&color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/SatisfyingButtons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Github&color=393939&labelColor=666666&style=for-the-badge&logo=Github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=393939&labelColor=fb594a&style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=393939&labelColor=33de61&style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172669/description_8a85bc5f-6502-4f6a-bff8-a2bb83b4efcc.png\"></p>\n<p>這個模塊還添加了<strong>淡入效果</strong>，讓懸停和非懸停過渡時可以添加華麗的動畫效果。默認情況下，當懸停於按鈕上時會添加輕微的深色覆蓋層，可以在配置中調整其顏色/透明度或禁用此功能。</p>\n<p>按鈕音效和懸停效果均可配置並可單獨關閉。音效的音高和音量可調，也可以使用資源包替換聲音文件。</p>\n<p>以下是默認 vanilla 配置的視頻演示：</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lpDF_YdFZjY\" width=\"850\" height=\"477\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252ftoni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/b73c0699-0836-43f4-801e-74b151d09f0a.png\"></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>",
